      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Can you do this?\n\u003e  if (!IS_ENABLED(\n\u003e     CONFIG_... \u0026\u0026\n\u003e     )\nSadly, no. The alignment and open paren makes 38 characters and the name is 44 characters! 😮 \n\n\u003e Worst case we can ignore the long line presubmit error. I\u0027d rather have a good name than try to force it to fit within 80 characters\nAgreed. I think we can find a shorter name that doesn\u0027t impact readability.\n\nI\u0027m going to close out this thread to reduce confusion and either get the name to fit or just accept that it doesn\u0027t.",
