      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T21:31:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, a good option might be to replace `CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT` and `CONFIG_PRINTF_DISABLE_32BIT_LONG_WORKAROUND` with a single flag named `CONFIG_PRINTF_ENABLE_32BIT_LONG_FMT` (or something similar). Thoughts?",
